---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Unpaid Salary Lawyer in Barcelona | Spain" description="Employment advice for unpaid salary and wage claims in Barcelona and Spain. Review payslips, outstanding amounts, employment documents and the next step.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Salary claims" title="If you have not been paid everything you are owed, start with the records." description="We can review payslips, employment documents, payment dates and the amounts you believe remain outstanding." primaryLabel="Discuss my salary claim" primaryHref="/en/contact" secondaryLabel="Employment law" secondaryHref="/en/employment" />
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Useful evidence</span><h2>Build the first picture from documents you already have.</h2></div><div class="prose"><ul><li>Employment contract and relevant amendments.</li><li>Payslips and bank records showing payments received, where relevant.</li><li>The dates and amounts you believe are outstanding.</li><li>Messages or company communications about the amounts.</li><li>Any prior complaint, settlement or response.</li></ul><p>The legal route and applicable deadlines depend on the claim, the period involved and the facts. A first review should establish exactly what is being claimed and on what basis.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container cards"><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Employees</span><h3>Unpaid salary</h3><p>Review what remains unpaid and which records support the amount.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Differences</span><h3>Salary differences</h3><p>Check whether contractual, collective or other remuneration rules may affect the figures.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div><span class="card-kicker">Process</span><h3>Next step</h3><p>Once the facts are clear, decide whether a formal claim, negotiation or another route needs to be considered.</p></div></div></div></section>
<CTA title="Need to check what you are owed?" text="Tell us the period, the amount you expected and what you actually received." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
